<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>DMA<sp/>{#DRIVERS_DMA_PAGE}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>DMA<sp/>driver<sp/>provides<sp/>API<sp/>to<sp/>configure<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>module.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Below<sp/>are<sp/>the<sp/>high<sp/>level<sp/>features<sp/>supported<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>driver.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Features<sp/>Supported</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28E12x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>2<sp/>DMA<sp/>channels<sp/>with<sp/>software<sp/>configurable<sp/>priority<sp/>levels<sp/>and<sp/>independent<sp/>PIPE<sp/>interrupts</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Channel<sp/>1<sp/>has<sp/>the<sp/>ability<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>configured<sp/>at<sp/>a<sp/>higher<sp/>priority<sp/>than<sp/>Channel<sp/>2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Up<sp/>to<sp/>63<sp/>hardware<sp/>trigger<sp/>sources<sp/>to<sp/>initiate<sp/>DMA<sp/>transfers</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28P55x<sp/>||<sp/>F28P551x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>6<sp/>DMA<sp/>channels<sp/>with<sp/>software<sp/>configurable<sp/>priority<sp/>levels<sp/>and<sp/>independent<sp/>PIPE<sp/>interrupts</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Up<sp/>to<sp/>93<sp/>hardware<sp/>trigger<sp/>sources<sp/>to<sp/>initiate<sp/>DMA<sp/>transfers</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Internal<sp/>trigger<sp/>generation<sp/>for<sp/>data<sp/>transfers<sp/>and<sp/>trigger<sp/>sources<sp/>for<sp/>channels</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Independent<sp/>Read<sp/>and<sp/>Write<sp/>buses</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Word<sp/>Size:<sp/>16-bit<sp/>or<sp/>32-bit<sp/>transfers<sp/>(SPI<sp/>limited<sp/>to<sp/>16-bit)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Throughput:<sp/>3<sp/>cycle/word<sp/>without<sp/>arbitration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Supports<sp/>linear<sp/>and<sp/>circular<sp/>addressing<sp/>modes</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Supports<sp/>multiple<sp/>data<sp/>transformation<sp/>functions<sp/>as<sp/>data<sp/>is<sp/>transferred<sp/>from<sp/>source<sp/>to<sp/>destination</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Burst<sp/>Mode<sp/>Support</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>SysConfig<sp/>Features</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">@VAR_SYSCFG_USAGE_NOTE</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>DMA<sp/>channel<sp/>selection<sp/>and<sp/>configuration.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Source<sp/>and<sp/>destination<sp/>address<sp/>setup<sp/>options.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Enabling<sp/>and<sp/>configuring<sp/>DMA<sp/>interrupt.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Configuring<sp/>DMA<sp/>Error<sp/>aggregator<sp/>events<sp/>in<sp/>Error<sp/>Signaling<sp/>Module.</highlight></codeline>
